      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} Sure! Here's an unlisted youtube video ~ taken on 1815\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OOhTrfHRMdQ\n\nIt appears best with a fully opaque mirror.\n\nI've been using the fluorescent lights on the ceiling of [this world](https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_81d1ce69-ef63-40a1-9798-83310cdff24b) as my go-to for testing but it works with any sufficiently contrasting surface.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
